WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.409
Eddy drove fast.

2
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:13.610
"Skidding is bad for tires," he thought.

3
00:00:13.611 --> 00:00:27.067
"But it’s fun!"

4
00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:30.928
Eddy jumped over the dirt hill.

5
00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:36.641
Then he skidded far.

6
00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:39.971
"Yes!" Eddy cried.

7
00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:50.551
Everyone cheered.

8
00:00:50.552 --> 00:00:53.177
Eddy drove off again.

9
00:00:53.178 --> 00:01:00.742
Zippy followed.

10
00:01:00.743 --> 00:01:03.930
They both skidded.

11
00:01:03.931 --> 00:01:06.491
Suddenly—

12
00:01:06.492 --> 00:01:09.274
Pop! "Oh no!" Eddy

13
00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:13.856
cried. "My tire

14
00:01:13.857 --> 00:01:17.333
popped!" "Ha-ha!" Zippy

15
00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:20.500
laughed. "Your tire—"

16
00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:30.682
Pop! "Ugh! My tire popped too!"

17
00:01:30.683 --> 00:01:36.712
Mr. Grill rushed outside.

18
00:01:36.713 --> 00:01:40.166
"What's going on?" he cried.

19
00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:44.231
"We were skidding," Eddy mumbled.

20
00:01:44.232 --> 00:01:48.592
"Our tires popped," said Zippy.

21
00:01:48.593 --> 00:01:54.908
Mr. Grill frowned.

22
00:01:54.909 --> 00:02:08.441
"Come with me," he said.

23
00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:18.523
Mr. Grill found new tires.

24
00:02:18.524 --> 00:02:22.631
"No more skidding," said the teacher.

25
00:02:22.632 --> 00:02:26.686
"Do you know why?"

26
00:02:26.687 --> 00:02:29.785
"Yes," said everyone.

27
00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:34.990
"It's bad for your tires!"

